WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.102
-You guys, there's a lot going
on in the news right now,

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.103
but instead of me
just telling you about it,

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.237
I thought it'd be nice
to give you the chance

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:06.139
to decide what we talk about.
That's right, it's time

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.041
for "You Pick the Joke."
Here we go.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.409
[ Cheering and applause ]
-♪ Joke ♪

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.609
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:12.778
♪ You Pick the Joke ♪

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:13.913
-So, here's how it works --

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:15.849
I'm going to show you
two news stories,

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.684
then you guys get to pick
which one we talk about, okay?

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:20.720
Alright, here we go. Let's take
a look at story number 1.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.422
-Finland is officially
joining NATO

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:25.391
as the military alliance's
31st member.

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:27.626
-Okay.
Here's story number 2.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:30.830
-A bizarre story
out of northwest Oklahoma City.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.265
A woman was trying
to break into a home.

00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:35.001
She gets stuck in a chimney

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.703
[ Laughter ]
and it turns out she was

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.170
not wearing any clothing.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.072
[ Laughter ]
-Alright.

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:41.741
Which story do you want
to talk about, 1 or 2?

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:44.209
-[ Bellowing ]
2!

00:00:44.209 --> 00:00:45.578
-Good choice.
Good choice.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:48.915
That's right, a woman got stuck
in a chimney, naked.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:51.050
It sounds like Mary Poppins
got an OnlyFans.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.953
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.322
Let's do another pair
of stories.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.657
Once again,
you guys get to pick.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:58.758
Here's story number 1.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.526
-The U.S. housing market split
in two.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.428
Prices are falling on one side
of the country,

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.063
still holding in there
on the other.

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:06.065
-Okay,
and here's story number 2.

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:08.234
-Police say that a man went
to extremes

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.170
to avoid capture after breaking
into a home in Florida.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.439
They actually found him
in the attic,

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:15.474
buried in the insulation,

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:17.677
with his face
against the air duct system

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.311
to breathe fresh air.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.380
[ Laughter ]
-What?!

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.982
-Which one you want to talk
about, 1 or 2?

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.850
-2!

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.419
-That's right,
a burglar tried to hide himself

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.821
by burying himself
under insulation.

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:29.956
This is also what it looks like

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:31.623
when you go skiing
with Gwyneth Paltrow.

00:01:31.623 --> 00:01:34.093
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:37.330
[ Cheering ]

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.764
Let's do one final round.

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:39.966
Here's story number 1.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.435
-Gas prices could soon be
headed higher,

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.437
after OPEC+ countries
announced

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.772
a major cutback
in oil production.

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.241
-And here's story number 2.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:51.710
-In Brevard County,
a ride to a job interview ends

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.012
with some charges.

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:55.114
A man was arrested
after allegedly going

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:59.052
100 miles per hour
in a 40 mile per hour zone.

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.320
He told police he had
to get his girlfriend

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.890
to a job interview
at a Taco Bell.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.358
[ Laughter ]
-Alright, which one?

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.525
Want to talk about 1?
You want to talk about 2?

00:02:06.525 --> 00:02:08.361
-[ Bellowing ] 2!
-Let's go with 2.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:09.629
Great choice.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:12.164
Usually, if you hear
100 miles per hour in Taco Bell,

00:02:12.164 --> 00:02:13.665
it's someone running
to the bathroom.

00:02:13.665 --> 00:02:14.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
There, you guys,

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.668
that's "You Pick the Joke."

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:16.702
[ Cheering ]

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:17.670
♪ You Pick the Joke ♪

00:02:19.238 --> 00:02:20.340
♪ You Pick the Joke ♪

